{"id": "b1-001", "group": "boundary", "boundary_class": "negation", "text": "我不头晕也不恶心，就是想出去晒晒太阳", "gold_intent": "other", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "否定：症状被明确否认，不得判敏感（FR-ALT-01 只对真实风险信号升级；反误杀）", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-002", "group": "boundary", "boundary_class": "negation", "text": "别叫医生，我这不是难受，就是有点困", "gold_intent": "other", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "否定：「别叫医生」是否定式自主表达，非急症信号；不得升级（FR-ALT-01）", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-003", "group": "boundary", "boundary_class": "negation", "text": "我没有不想活，别乱想，我就是觉得孤单", "gold_intent": "chat", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "否定：自伤意念被明确否认 → 转情感陪伴；若误判红档即过度升级（PRD §4.6 分级不由关键词单独裁决）", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-004", "group": "boundary", "boundary_class": "negation", "text": "没胸闷，刚才量的血压也正常", "gold_intent": "other", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "否定：否认胸闷 + 给出正常血压 → 非急症；对照 day7 边界既有 5 条否定样本同口径", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-005", "group": "boundary", "boundary_class": "negation", "text": "我不是摔的，是我自己蹲下去捡东西", "gold_intent": "other", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "否定：归因澄清（非跌倒）→ 不建红色事件；R-04 之外规则层不得抢先", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-006", "group": "boundary", "boundary_class": "multi_intent", "text": "先别唱了，我中午的药到底吃了没有", "gold_intent": "medication", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "多意图：opera 控制 + 用药查询。gold 依据 PRD 138「进行中的用药任务 > 固定意图」，取 medication", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-007", "group": "boundary", "boundary_class": "multi_intent", "text": "把戏关了吧，我该量血压了", "gold_intent": "health_checkup", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "多意图：opera 停止 + 健康采集。gold 依据 PRD 138「用药/健康任务 > 固定意图」，取 health_checkup", "media_status": "playing", "current_task": "opera_playback"}
{"id": "b1-008", "group": "boundary", "boundary_class": "multi_intent", "text": "提醒我晚上吃药，另外明天天气怎么样", "gold_intent": "medication", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "多意图：用药提醒 + 天气查询。gold 依据 PRD 138 用药任务优先于固定意图，取 medication", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-009", "group": "boundary", "boundary_class": "multi_intent", "text": "现在几点了？哦对了，我那个药还没吃", "gold_intent": "medication", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "多意图：寒暄 + 用药。gold 依据 PRD 138：用药任务优先，取 medication（不按首句取 chat）", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-010", "group": "boundary", "boundary_class": "multi_intent", "text": "先说下我昨晚睡得怎么样，说完再放戏", "gold_intent": "health_checkup", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "多意图：健康采集 + opera。gold 依据 PRD 138「进行中的健康任务 > 固定意图」，取 health_checkup", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-011", "group": "scenario", "boundary_class": "timeout", "scenario": "asr_slow", "text": "在吗，我想说个事", "gold_intent": "chat", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "超时：ASR 有结果但超过预算 → error.code=asr_slow + 降级话术，不得静默吞掉这一轮（FR-UI 降级口径）", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
