{"id": "b1-013", "group": "scenario", "boundary_class": "timeout", "scenario": "llm_slow", "text": "你跟我讲讲今天有什么新鲜事", "gold_intent": "chat", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "超时：LLM 超预算 → error.code=llm_slow，走降级话术而非挂起连接", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
