{"id": "b1-015", "group": "scenario", "boundary_class": "timeout", "scenario": "tool_timeout", "text": "帮我查一下明天天气", "gold_intent": "weather", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "超时：R-09 唯一直连工具超时 → error.code=tool_breaker，不得返回编造的天气数值", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-016", "group": "scenario", "boundary_class": "barge_in", "scenario": "barge_in_tts", "text": "停一下，我先说句话", "gold_intent": "chat", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "打断：播报中 barge-in → 前端 speechstart 立即停播、服务端停写轨清缓冲，不等服务端确认（Day6 两层口径）", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
{"id": "b1-017", "group": "scenario", "boundary_class": "barge_in", "scenario": "barge_in_interrupt_frame", "text": "别说了", "gold_intent": "chat", "is_sensitive": false, "note": "打断：命中 R-04 打断播报（intent=chat/action=agent，negation_safe=false 防「别」自否定）", "media_status": "idle", "current_task": "none"}
